    },
    {
      "fact": "The school year has 195 days and pupils attend 190; each school sets its own five staff training (inset) days and tells parents and carers.",
      "source": "https://www.swindon.gov.uk/info/20032/schools_and_education/14/dates_for_school_terms_and_holidays"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The council publishes six terms with a day count for each: 37, 35, 30, 24, 34 and 35 days in 2026-27.",
